{"term": {"label": "親", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 2, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "充", "id": "充"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "古", "id": "古"}, {"form": "名", "id": "名"}, {"form": "周", "id": "周"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "寡", "id": "寡"}, {"form": "實", "id": "實"}, {"form": "往", "id": "往"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "數", "id": "數"}, {"form": "昭昭", "id": "昭昭"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "殺", "id": "殺"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "親", "variants": [], "id": "親"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.6563214983329508, "source": "親", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.929287174145838, "source": "親", "target": "殺"}, {"weight": 2.7957557815213154, "source": "親", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 0.15224410155667667, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.557709209664841, "source": "人", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 0.9631743177730056, "source": "人", "target": "敵"}, {"weight": 1.6563214983329508, "source": "人", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 1.3198492617117379, "source": "人", "target": "殺"}, {"weight": 1.6563214983329508, "source": "人", "target": "名"}, {"weight": 0.04688358589885046, "source": "人", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.6563214983329508, "source": "人", "target": "昭昭"}, {"weight": 0.04688358589885046, "source": "人", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 0.2700271372130602, "source": "人", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 1.1454958745669601, "source": "人", "target": "充"}, {"weight": 0.9631743177730056, 